cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Spotkit
message: >-
  If you use Spotkit or build on its illustration system, a credit is
  appreciated.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Devesh
    family-names: Shirsath
    website: https://deveshshirsath.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Devesh-Shirsath/spotkit
url: https://github.com/Devesh-Shirsath/spotkit
abstract: >-
  Spotkit is a Claude Code skill that turns a feature description into a
  minimal, abstract product illustration, written as deterministic SVG rather
  than generated as an image. It ships twelve layouts, a documented visual
  language, and build-time guards so every illustration in a set belongs to the
  same family.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - claude-skill
  - product-illustration
  - spot-illustration
  - svg
  - design-system
  - empty-state
  - design-automation
license: MIT
